<title>GERMANY: Hoechst details unit results.</title>
<headline>Hoechst details unit results.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>The following tables gives the operating profit of each of</p>
<p>Hoechst's various units</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   4,067   vs 3,090</p>
<p>    Hoechst Marion Roussel		   2,009   vs 422</p>
<p>    Diagnostics				  62	vs 3</p>
<p>    AgrEvo					 285     vs 196</p>
<p>    Hoechst Roussel Vet			50	vs 34</p>
<p>    Basic Chemicals			    376     vs 1,081</p>
<p>    Specialty chemicals			530     vs 470</p>
<p>    Trevira					344     vs 545</p>
<p>    Plastics				     141     vs 247</p>
<p>    Technical polymers			 143     vs 64</p>
<p>    Messer					 330     vs 201</p>
<p>    Herberts				     58	vs 56</p>
<p>    Other business			     372     vs 350</p>
<p>    Corporate			    loss  633     vs 579 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals and drugs group is Hoechst AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
